## Authoring rules

- One invariant per row.
- Use MUST/MUST NOT language.
- Do not encode preferences as constraints.
- Do not add a constraint without a verification method.
- Project constraints may strengthen, but never weaken, global MUST rules.
- Delete the placeholder row if the project has no hard constraints yet.
